      "sourceTextSha256": "88fe6511e0b1e88c26113c9717d60241bd02c9415229c8e408531609fb1c5279",
      "text": "Day 7 · A half-day shared tour of Salvador’s essential sights, from the mouth of the immense bay along elegant tree-lined avenues to the Pelourinho, a UNESCO World Heritage Site and one of the largest ensembles of colonial architecture in South America. From the Municipal Square, by the towering Lacerda Elevator, stroll through narrow streets lined with pastel-coloured buildings, and visit the Church of São Francisco, with its exuberant gilded Baroque interior, and the Pelourinho square.",
